volves testing the overall functionality of the developed system.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"float\",\"name\":\"Transaction Volume\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Transaction Volume' represents the volume of transactions handled in dollars, ranging from $0.0 to $10,000,000.0.\",\"min_value\":0.0,\"max_value\":10000000.0,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Test System Functionality: Transaction Volume' links the 'Test System Functionality' activity with the 'Transaction Volume' attribute.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Application to Server\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Application to Server' activity represents deploying the application to a designated server environment.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Deployment Environment\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Deployment Environment' represents the target deployment environment, with possible values: Development, Staging, Production.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Development\",\"Staging\",\"Production\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Deploy Application to Server: Deployment Environment' links the 'Deploy Application to Server' activity with the 'Deployment Environment' attribute.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Monitor System Performance\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor System Performance' activity involves monitoring the performance and health of the deployed system.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Number of Bugs\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Number of Bugs' represents the number of known bugs in the system, ranging from 0 to 1000.\",\"min_value\":0,\"max_value\":1000,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Monitor System Performance: Number of Bugs' links the 'Monitor System Performance' activity with the 'Number of Bugs' attribute.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Gather User Feedback\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather User Feedback' activity represents collecting feedback from users about the system.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"float\",\"name\":\"User Satisfaction\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'User Satisfaction' represents the user satisfaction rating, ranging from 1.0 to 5.0.\",\"min_value\":1.0,\"max_value\":5.0,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Gather User Feedback: User Satisfaction' links the 'Gather User Feedback' activity with the 'User Satisfaction' attribute.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Update System Based on Feedback\",\"description\":\"The 'Update System Based on Feedback' activity involves updating and modifying the system based on gathered user feedback.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Feedback Type\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Feedback Type' represents the type of feedback received, with possible values: Bug Report, Feature Request, Improvement Suggestion.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Bug Report\",\"Feature Request\",\"Improvement Suggestion\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Update System Based on Feedback: Feedback Type' links the 'Update System Based on Feedback' activity with the 'Feedback Type' attribute.\"}],\"constraints\":[{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Define Project Scope' must be the first activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"Init\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Define Project Scope\",\"description\":\"The 'Define Project Scope' activity represents the initial planning phase where project boundaries, objectives, and status are established.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Frontend Interface' activity is permitted to occur only if a 'Design Database Schema' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Develop Frontend Interface\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Frontend Interface' activity represents the development of the user-facing frontend of the application.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Design Database Schema\",\"description\":\"The 'Design Database Schema' activity involves designing the database structure and schema for the software project.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Exactly one of the activities 'Design Database Schema' or 'Develop Frontend Interface' must occur in the process instance. This means that the process is compliant if only 'Design Database Schema' occurs without any occurrence of 'Develop Frontend Interface', or only 'Develop Frontend Interface' occurs without any occurrence of 'Design Database Schema'. The process is non-compliant if both occur or if neither occurs. The constraint enforces a mutual exclusivity and a mandatory occurrence of one of the specified activities.\",\"template\":\"Exclusive Choice\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Design Database Schema\",\"description\":\"The 'Design Database Schema' activity involves designing the database structure and schema for the software project.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Develop Frontend Interface\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Frontend Interface' activity represents the development of the user-facing frontend of the application.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Implement Backend Logic' activity occurs, then a 'Integrate Payment Gateway' activity must eventually occur after the 'Implement Backend Logic' event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Implement Backend Logic' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Integrate Payment Gateway' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Implement Backend Logic'. If 'Implement Backend Logic' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Integrate Payment Gateway'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Implement Backend Logic\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Backend Logic' activity involves implementing the server-side backend logic of the application.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Integrate Payment Gateway\",\"description\":\"The 'Integrate Payment Gateway' activity represents the integration of a payment processing gateway into the system.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Test System Functionality' activity occurs, then 'Deploy Application to Server' must also occur in the same process instance, and vice-versa.\",\"template\":\"Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Test System Functionality\",\"description\":\"The 'Test System Functionality' activity involves testing the overall functionality of the developed system.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Application to Server\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Application to Server' activity represents deploying the application to a designated server environment.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Deploy Application to Server' activity must be followed by a 'Monitor System Performance' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, a 'Monitor System Performance' event can occur only if a 'Deploy Application to Server' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Deploy Application to Server' impose obligations for future 'Monitor System Performance', and 'Monitor System Performance' cannot occur without prior 'Deploy Application to Server'.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Application to Server\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Application to Server' activity represents deploying the application to a designated server environment.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Monitor System Performance\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor System Performance' activity involves monitoring the performance and health of the deployed system.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Define Project Scope' activity cannot be preceded by a 'Gather User Feedback' within the same process instance. If a 'Gather User Feedback' event has occurred at any point before a 'Define Project Scope' event, then 'Define Project Scope' is disallowed. Multiple instances of 'Define Project Scope' and 'Gather User Feedback' can occur, but all instances of 'Define Project Scope' must occur before any instance of 'Gather User Feedback'.\",\"template\":\"Not Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Define Project Scope\",\"description\":\"The 'Define Project Scope' activity represents the initial planning phase where project boundaries, objectives, and status are established.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Gather User Feedback\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather User Feedback' activity represents collecting feedback from users about the system.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Define Project Scope' activity must not be followed by a 'Update System Based on Feedback' activity at any point later in the same process instance. This means that once a 'Define Project Scope' event occurs, 'Update System Based on Feedback' cannot occur afterward. However, 'Update System Based on Feedback' events occurring before the 'Define Project Scope' are permitted.\",\"template\":\"Not Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Define Project Scope\",\"description\":\"The 'Define Project Scope' activity represents the initial planning phase where project boundaries, objectives, and status are established.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Update System Based on Feedback\",\"description\":\"The 'Update System Based on Feedback' activity involves updating and modifying the system based on gathered user feedback.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Update System Based on Feedback' activity must occur at least once in the process.\",\"template\":\"Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Update System Based on Feedback\",\"description\":\"The 'Update System Based on Feedback' activity involves updating and modifying the system based on gathered user feedback.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":1},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Test System Functionality' must not occur more than 4 times in the process.\",\"template\":\"Absence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Test System Functionality\",\"description\":\"The 'Test System Functionality' activity involves testing the overall functionality of the developed system.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":4},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If the 'Project Status' is marked as Delayed during the 'Define Project Scope' phase, and the estimated 'Development Time' exceeds 1000 hours, then 'Design Database Schema' must be executed in response to 'Define Project Scope'. No specific time limit is enforced for this transition.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Define Project Scope\",\"description\":\"The 'Define Project Scope' activity represents the initial planning phase where project boundaries, objectives, and status are established.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Design Database Schema\",\"description\":\"The 'Design Database Schema' activity involves designing the database structure and schema for the software project.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Project Status is Delayed\",\"correlation_condition\":\"T.Development Time > 1000\",\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If the 'Payment Method' selected during 'Implement Backend Logic' is Credit Card, and the system anticipates a 'Number of Users' greater than 1000, then 'Integrate Payment Gateway' must be executed. This must occur within 1 hour of the backend logic being implemented.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Implement Backend Logic\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Backend Logic' activity involves implementing the server-side backend logic of the application.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Integrate Payment Gateway\",\"description\":\"The 'Integrate Payment Gateway' activity represents the integration of a payment processing gateway into the system.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Payment Method is Credit Card\",\"correlation_condition\":\"T.Number of Users > 1000\",\"time_condition\":\"0,1,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If the 'Deployment Environment' chosen is Production, and the system currently has fewer than 10 Bugs, then 'Monitor System Performance' must be executed. This monitoring must occur within 24 hours of the deployment.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Deploy Application to Server\",\"description\":\"The 'Deploy Application to Server' activity represents deploying the application to a designated server environment.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Monitor System Performance\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor System Performance' activity involves monitoring the performance and health of the deployed system.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Deployment Environment is Production\",\"correlation_condition\":\"T.Number of Bugs < 10\",\"time_condition\":\"0,24,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'User Satisfaction' drops below 3.0 during the 'Gather User Feedback' phase, and the 'Feedback Type' is identified as a Bug Report, then 'Update System Based on Feedback' must be executed. This update must happen within 1 day of receiving the feedback.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Gather User Feedback\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather User Feedback' activity represents collecting feedback from users about the system.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Update System Based on Feedback\",\"description\":\"The 'Update System Based on Feedback' activity involves updating and modifying the system based on gathered user feedback.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.User Satisfaction < 3.0\",\"correlation_condition\":\"T.Feedback Type is Bug Report\",\"time_condition\":\"0,1,d\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If the 'Transaction Volume' handled during 'Test System Functionality' exceeds 1,000,000.0, and the system supports a 'Number of Users' greater than 10,000, then 'Integrate Payment Gateway' must be executed. This integration must occur within 7 days of the testing phase.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Test System Functionality\",\"description\":\"The 'Test System Functionality' activity involves testing the overall functionality of the developed system.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Integrate Payment Gateway\",\"description\":\"The 'Integrate Payment Gateway' activity represents the integration of a payment processing gateway into the system.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Transaction Volume > 1000000.0\",\"correlation_condition\":\"T.Number of Users > 10000\",\"time_condition\":\"0,7,d\",\"cardinality\":null}]}"